🟠 postgres in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps running out of memory because its memory limit is too low for normal use. It was killed within 10 seconds of starting. Service postgres can't serve traffic. It runs a single replica. Fix: raise the memory limit of container app in deployment/postgres above 512Mi. To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs deploy/postgres -c app -n shop --previous
